Index: src/chrome/browser/ui/cocoa/arcium_settings_swift/VENDOR_PROVENANCE.md
===================================================================
--- src.orig/chrome/browser/ui/cocoa/arcium_settings_swift/VENDOR_PROVENANCE.md
+++ src/chrome/browser/ui/cocoa/arcium_settings_swift/VENDOR_PROVENANCE.md
@@ -23,3 +23,8 @@ The host owns preference validation and
 shortcut recording, calibrated glass opacity and the dynamic library boundary.
 The layout refresh adds grouped rows and live-edit customization sheets without
 another store. Trailing whitespace is normalized for Quilt.
+
+Arcium form hierarchy keeps flat settings groups free of automatic row dividers.
+Grouped section headings use the section type style and header accessibility
+traits; glow-editor subheadings use a smaller secondary style distinct from card
+titles. The host retains the package's existing aligned row controls.
